# Key Design Decisions

## Modular Architecture

Each system is independent and swappable.

---

## Hierarchical Configuration

Experiment configs inherit from base configs.

---

## Separated Controller

Controller exists independently from engine simulation.

---

## Experiment-Driven Design

The project is designed for testing and comparison, not only simulation.

